<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69148" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύλος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], ὁ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύλη</span>
			, <i>mill</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				11.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.549d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				830d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. καβαλλαρικὸς ἐν λίθοις, μ.
				ὀνικός, μ. ὑδραλετικός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Edict.Diocl.</u>
				15.52
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				54
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>millstone, PCair. Zen.</i><i><span class="en">
				355.84
			</span></i> (dub., <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.253
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὴ ἔρριψε κλάσμα μύλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ki.</u>
					11.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ὀνικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>En. Matt.</u>
					18.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				9.42
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύλους σφυρηλάτους ἀργυροῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					4.1.13
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψὲ θεῶν ἀλέουσι μύλοι, ἀλέουσι δὲ
					λεπτά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>App.Prov.</u>
					4.48
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>stone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Steril.</u>
				241
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>grinder, molar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> poet. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύλλος</span> (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.130
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύλη</span>
			 IV, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμυλώθη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
